{%- comment -%} English product descriptions (store descriptions are written in Arabic). Faithful translations of each product's own Arabic copy — no added claims. Param: handle {%- endcomment -%}
{%- case handle -%}
  {%- when 'kojic-acid-turmeric-brightening-gel-mask-28g' -%}<p>Medicube's Kojic Acid Turmeric Brightening Gel Mask brightens the skin and targets pigmentation with an effective formula. Kojic acid and turmeric — both known for their anti-pigmentation properties — leave skin looking brighter and fresher.</p>
  {%- when 'pdrn-pink-collagen-mask-28g' -%}<p>Medicube's PDRN Pink Collagen Mask is a premium sheet mask that revives tired skin. A blend of PDRN and collagen helps firm the skin, soften the look of fine lines and leave a healthy, visible glow.</p>
  {%- when 'cicaplast-b5-repairing-balm-100ml' -%}<p>La Roche-Posay Cicaplast Baume B5+ is a multi-purpose repairing balm for dry, cracked and damaged skin. Its formula combines panthenol, shea butter and madecassoside to support skin recovery and protect it from external aggressors.</p>
  {%- when 'hydraphase-ha-intense-eyes-15ml' -%}<p>La Roche-Posay Hydraphase HA Intense Eyes hydrates and smooths the delicate eye area. A dual-weight hyaluronic acid formula delivers intense hydration to the thin skin around the eyes while helping reduce the look of puffiness and dark circles.</p>
  {%- when 'pore-dark-spot-brightening-care-sunscreen-spf50-50ml' -%}<p>Celimax Pore + Dark Spot Brightening Sunscreen SPF50 combines sun protection and pigmentation care in one step. It helps refine the look of pores, fade dark spots and give skin a healthy radiance, with full UV protection.</p>
  {%- when 'glow-sunscreen-stick-spf50-18g' -%}<p>Anua Glow Sunscreen Stick SPF50+ gives full protection with a healthy, luminous finish. The compact stick is easy to carry and reapply at any time, leaves a subtle glow and no white cast.</p>
  {%- when 'glutathiosome-dark-spot-serum-50ml' -%}<p>Abib Glutathiosome Dark Spot Serum targets stubborn pigmentation with glutathiosome technology. It helps even out skin tone and fade dark spots, melasma and sun-induced pigmentation for brighter, more radiant skin.</p>
  {%- when 'deep-cera-vitamin-illuminating-serum-30ml' -%}<p>Eqqualberry Deep Cera Vitamin Illuminating Serum strengthens the skin barrier and brings radiance from within. Deep ceramides and stabilised vitamin C help even out skin tone, nourish and protect, for a glass-skin glow.</p>
  {%- when 'relaxing-ampoule-30ml' -%}<p>I'm Sorry For My Skin Relaxing Ampoule deeply soothes irritated, sensitive skin. A concentrated formula of calming ingredients helps reduce redness and discomfort, bringing instant comfort and lasting hydration.</p>
  {%- when 'purple-pdrn-pore-minimizing-serum' -%}<p>Eqqualberry Purple PDRN Pore Minimizing Serum helps refine enlarged pores and renew the skin. PDRN technology supports skin renewal, tightens the look of pores and smooths skin texture.</p>
  {%- when 'zombie-beauty-bloody-peel-30ml' -%}<p>Zombie Beauty Bloody Peel by SKIN1004 renews the skin and effectively removes dead skin cells. A blend of AHA and BHA exfoliates gently to improve texture, refine the look of pores and leave skin visibly fresher and brighter.</p>
  {%- when 'age-capture-skin-relief-cream-50g' -%}<p>I'm Sorry For My Skin Age Capture Skin Relief Cream hydrates and calms stressed skin. Its advanced formula helps reduce visible signs of ageing, restore elasticity and deeply nourish for a younger, refreshed look.</p>
  {%- when 'glutathione-glow-serum-30ml' -%}<p>Medicube Glutathione Glow Serum brightens the skin and gives it a glass-like glow. Rich in glutathione and antioxidants, it targets pigmentation and dark spots and helps even out skin tone.</p>
  {%- when 'cicaplast-gel-b5-pro-40ml' -%}<p>La Roche-Posay Cicaplast Gel B5 Pro supports the recovery of damaged, irritated skin. Its Pro-Recovery formula with panthenol (B5) and centella extract helps calm redness and repair the skin barrier.</p>
  {%- when 'dark-spot-correcting-glow-serum-50ml' -%}<p>AXIS-Y Dark Spot Correcting Glow Serum targets pigmentation and gives skin a natural glow. A blend of brightening ingredients helps even out skin tone, reduce dark spots and boost radiance.</p>
  {%- when 'purple-rice-anti-pores-cleansing-oil-200ml' -%}<p>Eqqualberry Purple Rice Anti-Pores Cleansing Oil melts away impurities and waterproof makeup. Purple rice extract, rich in antioxidants, helps cleanse and refine pores while keeping the skin balanced.</p>
  {%- when 'niacinamide-20-serum-40ml' -%}<p>Jumiso Niacinamide 20 Serum evens out skin tone, refines the look of pores and fades dark spots. A 20% niacinamide concentration targets pigmentation and redness and visibly improves skin texture.</p>
  {%- when 'invisible-matte-finish-sunscreen-spf50-50ml' -%}<p>Anua Invisible Matte Finish Sunscreen SPF50 offers high protection while controlling shine. Lightweight with no white cast — ideal for oily and combination skin. Helps makeup stay in place and leaves a smooth finish all day.</p>
  {%- when 'azelaic-acid-16-bb-calming-serum-30ml' -%}<p>Medicube Azelaic Acid 16 BB Calming Serum targets breakouts, evens out skin tone and reduces redness. A high concentration of azelaic acid helps fight acne and dark spots while calming irritated skin.</p>
  {%- when 'pure-grinding-cleansing-balm-50ml' -%}<p>Dr. Althea Pure Grinding Cleansing Balm gently and effectively melts away makeup and impurities. The balm turns milky on contact with water and cleanses deeply without stripping the skin's natural moisture. Ideal as the first step of a double cleanse.</p>
  {%- when 'nad-retinol-volumetox-eye-cream-20ml' -%}<p>numbuzin NAD+ Retinol Volumetox Eye Cream targets signs of ageing around the eyes. NAD+ and retinol help soften fine lines and dark circles and smooth the eye area.</p>
  {%- when 'pdrn-pink-caffeine-night-wrapping-mask' -%}<p>Medicube PDRN Pink Caffeine Night Wrapping Mask refreshes the skin and helps reduce puffiness and dark circles. It works overnight to support skin renewal and leave a healthy glow.</p>
  {%- when 'blue-blow-hyaluronic-flooding-serum-30ml' -%}<p>Eqqualberry Blue Blow Hyaluronic Flooding Serum floods the skin with moisture and plumps dehydration lines. Multi-weight hyaluronic acid reaches different layers of the skin for deep, lasting hydration through the day.</p>
  {%- when 'collagen-night-wrapping-mask-75ml' -%}<p>Medicube Collagen Night Wrapping Mask nourishes and revitalises the skin while you sleep. Rich in collagen and deep-hydrating agents for noticeably softer skin by morning — ideal for mature or dry skin that needs renewal.</p>
  {%- when 'cicaplast-hand-cream-50ml' -%}<p>La Roche-Posay Cicaplast Hand Cream hydrates and repairs dry, cracked skin. Suitable for sensitive skin and safe during pregnancy. It helps restore the skin's natural barrier and leaves hands soft and comfortable.</p>
  {%- when 'dark-spot-cream' -%}<details style="background:#efede8;padding:14px;border-radius:12px;margin-bottom:12px;"><summary style="cursor:pointer;font-weight:bold;">Description</summary><p style="margin-top:10px;">This AXIS-Y dark spot correcting formula helps even out skin tone and gives a natural glow thanks to its blend of effective ingredients. It helps reduce pigmentation, melasma and post-acne marks for brighter, more even skin.</p></details><details style="background:#efede8;padding:14px;border-radius:12px;margin-bottom:12px;"><summary style="cursor:pointer;font-weight:bold;">Benefits</summary><p style="margin-top:10px;">✔ Effectively reduces dark spots and pigmentation<br>✔ Evens out skin tone for a natural radiance<br>✔ Suitable for all skin types, including sensitive<br>✔ Helps fade post-acne marks and melasma<br>✔ Visible results with consistent use</p></details><details style="background:#efede8;padding:14px;border-radius:12px;"><summary style="cursor:pointer;font-weight:bold;">How to use</summary><p style="margin-top:10px;">1. Apply to clean skin after toner<br>2. Apply a suitable amount to the face<br>3. Focus on dark spots and pigmented areas<br>4. Use morning and evening<br>5. Always follow with SPF50 in the morning</p></details>
  {%- when 'age-r-pink-glow-set' -%}<details style="background:#efede8;padding:14px;border-radius:12px;margin-bottom:12px;"><summary style="cursor:pointer;font-weight:bold;">Description</summary><p style="margin-top:10px;">Glow System Set — complete skincare for healthy, radiant skin.</p></details><details style="background:#efede8;padding:14px;border-radius:12px;margin-bottom:12px;"><summary style="cursor:pointer;font-weight:bold;">In the set</summary><p style="margin-top:10px;"><b>MEDICUBE Age-R PRO Booster Mini</b> — A device that helps boost the absorption of your skincare, supports collagen and gives an instant fresh look with regular use.<br><b>MEDICUBE PDRN Pink Collagen Capsule</b> — Capsules rich in collagen and PDRN that deeply hydrate, improve elasticity and soften the look of fine lines.</p></details><details style="background:#efede8;padding:14px;border-radius:12px;margin-bottom:12px;"><summary style="cursor:pointer;font-weight:bold;">Benefits</summary><p style="margin-top:10px;">✔ Improves skin texture<br>✔ Boosts hydration and freshness<br>✔ Supports collagen production<br>✔ Faster results when the device is used with the capsules<br>✔ Suitable for all skin types<br>✔ Mini size — practical for travel and daily use</p></details><details style="background:#efede8;padding:14px;border-radius:12px;"><summary style="cursor:pointer;font-weight:bold;">How to use</summary><p style="margin-top:10px;">1. Apply the capsules to clean skin<br>2. Glide the Age-R Booster gently over the skin to boost absorption</p></details>
  {%- when 'dr-althea-345-relief-cream-50ml-post-acne-soothing-care' -%}<details style="background:#efede8;padding:14px;border-radius:12px;margin-bottom:12px;"><summary style="cursor:pointer;font-weight:bold;">Description</summary><p style="margin-top:10px;">A soothing cream designed for post-acne skin. It helps calm irritation and reduce redness while deeply hydrating, for instant comfort and a healthy look.</p></details><details style="background:#efede8;padding:14px;border-radius:12px;margin-bottom:12px;"><summary style="cursor:pointer;font-weight:bold;">Benefits</summary><p style="margin-top:10px;">✔ Calms sensitive and irritated skin<br>✔ Helps reduce post-acne marks and redness<br>✔ Deeply hydrates without a greasy feel<br>✔ Helps repair the skin barrier<br>✔ Suitable for sensitive and acne-prone skin</p></details><details style="background:#efede8;padding:14px;border-radius:12px;"><summary style="cursor:pointer;font-weight:bold;">How to use</summary><p style="margin-top:10px;">1. Apply to clean skin after cleansing<br>2. Apply a suitable amount to the face<br>3. Massage gently until absorbed<br>4. Use morning and evening</p></details>
  {%- when 'the-ordinary-glycolic-acid-7-exfoliating-toner' -%}<details style="background:#efede8;padding:14px;border-radius:12px;margin-bottom:12px;"><summary style="cursor:pointer;font-weight:bold;">Description</summary><p style="margin-top:10px;">An exfoliating toner with 7% glycolic acid (AHA) that helps remove dead skin cells and improve texture, for visible radiance and smoother, clearer-looking skin.</p></details><details style="background:#efede8;padding:14px;border-radius:12px;margin-bottom:12px;"><summary style="cursor:pointer;font-weight:bold;">Benefits</summary><p style="margin-top:10px;">✔ Gently exfoliates and removes dead skin cells<br>✔ Helps brighten and even out skin tone<br>✔ Helps reduce the look of blemishes and marks<br>✔ Improves texture for smoother skin<br>✔ Visibly boosts radiance</p></details><details style="background:#efede8;padding:14px;border-radius:12px;"><summary style="cursor:pointer;font-weight:bold;">How to use</summary><p style="margin-top:10px;">1. Use in the evening only<br>2. Apply to clean, dry skin<br>3. Sweep over the face with a cotton pad<br>4. Do not rinse off<br>5. Use sunscreen in the morning</p></details>
  {%- when 'glass-skin-glow-✨' -%}<details style="background:#efede8;padding:14px;border-radius:12px;margin-bottom:12px;"><summary style="cursor:pointer;font-weight:bold;">Description</summary><p style="margin-top:10px;">The Glass Skin Glow Set by Eqqualberry — a two-serum duo for clear, glass-like skin. NAD+ Peptide Serum to firm, paired with Bakuchiol Serum to plump and smooth, for a full, luminous result without irritation.</p></details><details style="background:#efede8;padding:14px;border-radius:12px;margin-bottom:12px;"><summary style="cursor:pointer;font-weight:bold;">In the set</summary><p style="margin-top:10px;"><b>EQQUALBERRY NAD+ Peptide Boosting Serum</b> — Peptide serum with NAD+ that boosts freshness, firmness and helps reduce fine lines.<br><b>EQQUALBERRY Bakuchiol Plumping Serum</b> — Bakuchiol serum, a natural alternative to retinol, that plumps the skin and makes it softer and more supple without irritation.</p></details><details style="background:#efede8;padding:14px;border-radius:12px;margin-bottom:12px;"><summary style="cursor:pointer;font-weight:bold;">Benefits</summary><p style="margin-top:10px;">✔ Glass-skin finish — clear and luminous<br>✔ Improves elasticity and reduces fine lines<br>✔ Deeply hydrates for a naturally plump look<br>✔ Evens out skin tone and boosts radiance<br>✔ Suitable for all skin types, including sensitive</p></details><details style="background:#efede8;padding:14px;border-radius:12px;"><summary style="cursor:pointer;font-weight:bold;">How to use</summary><p style="margin-top:10px;">1. Apply to clean skin after toner<br>2. Apply 2–3 drops of the NAD+ serum first<br>3. Pat until absorbed, then apply the Bakuchiol serum<br>4. Use morning and evening<br>5. Always follow with SPF50 in the morning</p></details>
  {%- when 'repair-lift' -%}<details style="background:#efede8;padding:14px;border-radius:12px;margin-bottom:12px;"><summary style="cursor:pointer;font-weight:bold;">Description</summary><p style="margin-top:10px;">The Repair &amp; Lift Set by Eqqualberry and Dr. Althea — a complete routine to repair and firm tired skin. NAD+ peptides paired with PDRN technology help renew the skin and reduce signs of ageing for a firmer, healthier look.</p></details><details style="background:#efede8;padding:14px;border-radius:12px;margin-bottom:12px;"><summary style="cursor:pointer;font-weight:bold;">In the set</summary><p style="margin-top:10px;"><b>EQQUALBERRY NAD+ Peptide Boosting Serum</b> — Peptide serum with NAD+ that energises the skin, boosts elasticity and helps reduce fine lines.<br><b>Dr. Althea PDRN REJ5000 Cream</b> — Advanced PDRN cream that deeply renews the skin and supports collagen for a plumper, younger look.</p></details><details style="background:#efede8;padding:14px;border-radius:12px;margin-bottom:12px;"><summary style="cursor:pointer;font-weight:bold;">Benefits</summary><p style="margin-top:10px;">✔ Visibly firms and lifts the skin<br>✔ Reduces fine lines and wrinkles<br>✔ Supports skin renewal and collagen<br>✔ Deeply hydrates for a plump look<br>✔ Suitable for mature and tired skin</p></details><details style="background:#efede8;padding:14px;border-radius:12px;"><summary style="cursor:pointer;font-weight:bold;">How to use</summary><p style="margin-top:10px;">1. Apply to clean skin after toner<br>2. Apply 2–3 drops of the NAD+ serum and pat gently<br>3. Once absorbed, apply the PDRN cream as the last step<br>4. Use morning and evening<br>5. Always follow with SPF50 in the morning</p></details>
  {%- when 'acne-control-power' -%}<details style="background:#efede8;padding:14px;border-radius:12px;margin-bottom:12px;"><summary style="cursor:pointer;font-weight:bold;">Description</summary><p style="margin-top:10px;">The Acne Control Set by Medicube — a Korean solution for breakouts on the face and body. Succinic acid peeling pads paired with an exfoliating body spray to deeply cleanse pores, reduce breakouts and remove dead skin cells.</p></details><details style="background:#efede8;padding:14px;border-radius:12px;margin-bottom:12px;"><summary style="cursor:pointer;font-weight:bold;">In the set</summary><p style="margin-top:10px;"><b>medicube Red Succinic Acid Peeling Pad</b> — Exfoliating pads with succinic acid that clean pores, reduce breakouts and calm the skin. For the face.<br><b>medicube Red Acne Body Peeling Shot</b> — Exfoliating body spray that targets back and body breakouts for smoother, clearer skin.</p></details><details style="background:#efede8;padding:14px;border-radius:12px;margin-bottom:12px;"><summary style="cursor:pointer;font-weight:bold;">Benefits</summary><p style="margin-top:10px;">✔ Reduces breakouts on face and body<br>✔ Deeply cleans pores and removes blackheads<br>✔ Gently exfoliates dead skin cells<br>✔ Calms inflammation and helps prevent new breakouts<br>✔ Suitable for oily and combination skin</p></details><details style="background:#efede8;padding:14px;border-radius:12px;"><summary style="cursor:pointer;font-weight:bold;">How to use</summary><p style="margin-top:10px;">1. After cleansing, sweep a pad gently over the face<br>2. Do not rinse after the pad — let it work<br>3. On the body, spray the peeling shot onto the areas needed<br>4. Leave for 3–5 minutes, then rinse with water<br>5. Use the spray 2–3 times a week</p></details>
  {%- when 'ترطيب-وتنظيف-المسام-✨' -%}<details style="background:#efede8;padding:14px;border-radius:12px;margin-bottom:12px;"><summary style="cursor:pointer;font-weight:bold;">Description</summary><p style="margin-top:10px;">Hydrate &amp; Pore Refine Set — a daily routine pairing instant hydration from a mist with deep pore cleansing from pads. Refreshes the skin, reduces the look of pores and leaves a healthy natural glow without oiliness.</p></details><details style="background:#efede8;padding:14px;border-radius:12px;margin-bottom:12px;"><summary style="cursor:pointer;font-weight:bold;">In the set</summary><p style="margin-top:10px;"><b>Dr. Althea Aqua Marine Jelly Mist 100ml</b> — A water-gel mist for instant hydration and lasting freshness. Ideal during the day or before makeup.<br><b>medicube Zero Pore Pad</b> — Daily pads with AHA + BHA that deeply clean pores and remove excess oil for smooth, clear skin.</p></details><details style="background:#efede8;padding:14px;border-radius:12px;margin-bottom:12px;"><summary style="cursor:pointer;font-weight:bold;">Benefits</summary><p style="margin-top:10px;">✔ Reduces the look of pores and cleans them deeply<br>✔ Hydrates instantly and throughout the day<br>✔ Removes excess oil without drying<br>✔ Leaves a healthy natural glow<br>✔ Suitable for oily and combination skin</p></details><details style="background:#efede8;padding:14px;border-radius:12px;"><summary style="cursor:pointer;font-weight:bold;">How to use</summary><p style="margin-top:10px;">1. Morning: sweep a pad over the face after cleansing<br>2. Do not rinse after the pad<br>3. Spray the mist onto the face from a comfortable distance<br>4. Use the mist to hydrate any time during the day<br>5. Use the pads 2–3 times a week or daily, depending on your skin</p></details>
  {%- when 'eqqualberry-nad-peptide-boosting-serum' -%}<details style="background:#efede8;padding:14px;border-radius:12px;margin-bottom:12px;"><summary style="cursor:pointer;font-weight:bold;">Description</summary><p style="margin-top:10px;">An advanced serum with NAD+ and peptides that boosts freshness and improves elasticity. It helps reduce signs of fatigue and fine lines for plump, healthy-looking radiant skin.</p></details><details style="background:#efede8;padding:14px;border-radius:12px;margin-bottom:12px;"><summary style="cursor:pointer;font-weight:bold;">Benefits</summary><p style="margin-top:10px;">✔ Boosts freshness for a healthy glow<br>✔ Helps firm the skin and reduce fine lines<br>✔ Peptides support skin elasticity<br>✔ Deeply hydrates for a naturally plump look<br>✔ Suitable for all skin types</p></details><details style="background:#efede8;padding:14px;border-radius:12px;"><summary style="cursor:pointer;font-weight:bold;">How to use</summary><p style="margin-top:10px;">1. Apply to clean skin after toner<br>2. Apply 2–3 drops to the face<br>3. Massage gently until absorbed<br>4. Use morning and evening<br>5. Follow with sunscreen in the morning</p></details>
  {%- when 'eqqualberry-bakuchiol-plumping-serum-30ml' -%}<details style="background:#efede8;padding:14px;border-radius:12px;margin-bottom:12px;"><summary style="cursor:pointer;font-weight:bold;">Description</summary><p style="margin-top:10px;">A bakuchiol serum that gives the skin firmness and elasticity without irritation. It helps reduce fine lines and deeply hydrates for a naturally firm, radiant look.</p></details><details style="background:#efede8;padding:14px;border-radius:12px;margin-bottom:12px;"><summary style="cursor:pointer;font-weight:bold;">Benefits</summary><p style="margin-top:10px;">✔ A natural alternative to retinol, without irritation<br>✔ Helps firm the skin and reduce lines<br>✔ Deep hydration and softness<br>✔ Improves elasticity and boosts freshness<br>✔ Suitable for all skin types, including sensitive</p></details><details style="background:#efede8;padding:14px;border-radius:12px;"><summary style="cursor:pointer;font-weight:bold;">How to use</summary><p style="margin-top:10px;">1. Apply to clean skin after toner<br>2. Apply 2–3 drops to the face<br>3. Massage gently until absorbed<br>4. Use morning and evening<br>5. Follow with sunscreen in the morning</p></details>
  {%- when 'anua-heartleaf-quercetinol-pore-deep-cleansing-foam-150-ml' -%}<details style="background:#efede8;padding:14px;border-radius:12px;margin-bottom:12px;"><summary style="cursor:pointer;font-weight:bold;">Description</summary><p style="margin-top:10px;">A deep pore cleanser with heartleaf extract and BHA. It helps deeply cleanse the skin, remove impurities and excess oil while calming the skin, for a clean, fresh feel from the first use.</p></details><details style="background:#efede8;padding:14px;border-radius:12px;margin-bottom:12px;"><summary style="cursor:pointer;font-weight:bold;">Benefits</summary><p style="margin-top:10px;">✔ Deeply cleans pores and removes impurities<br>✔ Reduces excess oil and balances the skin<br>✔ BHA gently clears pores<br>✔ Heartleaf extract calms the skin<br>✔ Suitable for oily, combination and sensitive skin</p></details><details style="background:#efede8;padding:14px;border-radius:12px;"><summary style="cursor:pointer;font-weight:bold;">How to use</summary><p style="margin-top:10px;">1. Wet the face with water<br>2. Apply a suitable amount of cleanser<br>3. Massage gently into a lather<br>4. Rinse well with water<br>5. Use morning and evening</p></details>
  {%- when 'beauty-of-joseon-relief-sun-rice-probiotics-spf-50-50ml' -%}<details style="background:#efede8;padding:14px;border-radius:12px;margin-bottom:12px;"><summary style="cursor:pointer;font-weight:bold;">Description</summary><p style="margin-top:10px;">A lightweight, creamy, hydrating sunscreen that offers high sun protection while nourishing the skin with rice extract and probiotics — healthy, radiant skin with no white cast.</p></details><details style="background:#efede8;padding:14px;border-radius:12px;margin-bottom:12px;"><summary style="cursor:pointer;font-weight:bold;">Benefits</summary><p style="margin-top:10px;">✔ High protection SPF50+ PA++++<br>✔ Hydrates for a natural radiance<br>✔ No white cast<br>✔ Lightweight and fast-absorbing<br>✔ Suitable for all skin types, including sensitive</p></details><details style="background:#efede8;padding:14px;border-radius:12px;"><summary style="cursor:pointer;font-weight:bold;">How to use</summary><p style="margin-top:10px;">1. Apply as the last step of your morning routine<br>2. Apply a generous amount to face and neck<br>3. Reapply every 2–3 hours when in the sun<br>4. Use daily for full protection</p></details>
